#: ../../src/MaximaCommandMenus.cpp:619
msgid ""
"Maxima allows making functions \"nouns\", which means that they aren't "
"automatically evaluated as soon as Maxima encounters them.\n"
"Ways to make a function a noun include declaring it a noun, preceding it "
"with a single quote or putting it between the parentheses of '().\n"
"\n"
"This command tells Maxima that the nouns in this expression shall now be "
"evaluated, too."
msgstr ""

