#: ../../src/wxMaxima.cpp:2657
#, c-format
msgid ""
"Maxima has started, but hasn't connected to wxMaxima yet.\n"
"\n"
"On macOS this can happen if Gatekeeper has quarantined the Maxima binary -- "
"common if it wasn't installed via a signed installer (e.g. via Homebrew): "
"the process starts, but macOS silently prevents it from actually running "
"instead of showing a security prompt, since a background process spawned by "
"wxMaxima can never answer one.\n"
"\n"
"Try running Maxima once directly from a Terminal:\n"
"\n"
"%s\n"
"\n"
"If macOS shows a security prompt there, allow it. Otherwise you can remove "
"the quarantine flag directly with:\n"
"\n"
"xattr -d com.apple.quarantine %s\n"
"\n"
"Then restart wxMaxima. wxMaxima will keep waiting and periodically retry in "
"the meantime."
msgstr ""

