"Sometimes one wants maxima to loose the information that a function name was "
"used with the ' operator in order to make maxima not evaluate it. In other "
"places one wants % to mean \"the last expression at the time this function "
"was created\", not \"the last expression now\".\n"
"In both cases the '' operator will do what is requested."
