#~ "Unicode characters, represented by different Unicode code points "
#~ "(numbers).  > > This might be problematic, if you assign a value to the "
#~ "Variable A and later > use the Greek letter Alpha to do something with "
#~ "this variable, especially on printouts.  > For the Greek letter my (which "
#~ "is also used as prefix for micro) there are also two > different Unicode "
